<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><image binderror="imageFailed" class="cover" src="{{region.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="surface"><text class="eyebrow">模拟产区档案</text><text class="page-title">{{region.name}}</text><text class="body-copy">{{region.description}}</text><text wx:if="{{region.preview}}" class="note">这个地区正在筹备，暂时没有可下单商品。</text></view><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">这里的采购者</text></view><view wx:for="{{shops}}" wx:key="id" class="shop-row" data-page="shop" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><view class="shop-icon">采</view><view class="grow"><text class="product-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.regionLabel}}</text></view><text>→</text></view><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">产区好物</text></view><view class="product-grid"><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="product-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><image binderror="imageFailed" class="product-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="product-copy"><text class="product-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.origin}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.videoMediaId}}" class="tag media-video-tag">含演示采摘视频</text><view class="price-line"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceText}}</text><text class="muted small">起 · 模拟</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length}}" class="empty">好物尚在筹备，先去其他产区逛逛。<button class="secondary" data-page="regions" bindtap="go">返回产区</button></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
